WURtUExrd3c?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"隨著儲存實力提升第一季業績和指引，Sandisk 振作起來；公佈 8-1 股票分割（SNDK：納斯達克）"},{"title":"Sandisk slips even as storage strength boosts Q1 results, guidance; unveils 8-1 stock split","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"儘管儲存實力提升了第一季的業績和指引，但 Sandisk 仍出現下滑；公佈8-1股票分割"},{"title":"GUIDANCE: (SNDK) Sandisk Corporation Expects Q2 Adjusted EPS Range $55.00 - $57.00","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQbl9JSXJjTldEeGxFSm1ITERibTljbVkydElRMkhxSkxIQldqUkw1M0hNSjhvZWRieVBhbDJmUnlta3FlY1cxZF90OTcyNjVkUFlpMDBaZDFMNnlMcVVoNmZQdFhCZTdfNEJva2pJaXZ0VWJQSDRIUmliUUVZbWx2U0hac3FOVWRuS1FRenMtOWxuTk1FZjhVWGVhOE5pOGRWVWJLUUdpdkdBM0VpT3Aw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"指引：(SNDK)Sandisk 公司預計第二季調整後每股盈餘範圍為 55.00 美元 - 57.00 美元"},{"title":"Sandisk (SNDK) Tops Q1 EPS by $2.36, Beats on Revenue; Offers Q2 Guidance","src":"StreetInsider","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Sandisk (SNDK) 第一季​​度每股收益成長 2.36 美元，營收優於預期；提供第二季指引"},{"title":"Sandisk Beats Forecasts and Lifts Guidance","src":"AskTraders.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNTXZraU10Rk9oUGpQT2VrS0dXN1dpX1VoMEt4T3N1aE85QVNYTVBlV1hTQnYzQ0VhYzdUaVBfR29WYWRWak52OHJ6MzF3OFBCTC1aQ0J6ZFplbjVnYnJtRUZrclN4NDRZVEc2MUtFODZ2ek1tTlo1TjAxLXN4RzVRUFdtM2pDQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Sandisk 超越預測並提升指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":10},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-17","period":"2026-07-03","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2023554/000162828026057406/sndk-20260703.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Prior to February 21, 2025, we were wholly owned by Western Digital Corporation (\"WDC\"). As of February 21, 2025, we separated from WDC (the \"separation\") and became a standalone publicly traded company, trading under the stock symbol \"SNDK\" on the Nasdaq Global Select Market. For more information about the separation, see Part II, Item 7., Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations and Part II, Item 8., Note 1, Organization, Basis of Presentation and Summary of Significant Accounting Policies of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in this Annual Report on Form 10-K.","zh":"2025 年 2 月 21 日之前，我們由西部數據公司（「WDC」）全資擁有。自 2025 年 2 月 21 日起，我們從 WDC 分離（「分離」），成為一家獨立的上市公司，在納斯達克全球精選市場上以股票代碼「SNDK」進行交易。有關分拆的更多資訊，請參閱本年度報告 10-K 表格中的第二部分第 7 項“管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論與分析”和第二部分第 8 項附註 1“組織、列報基礎以及合併財務報表附註的重要會計政策摘要”。"},{"en":"Sandisk is a leading global semiconductor memory company with more than 30 years of innovation in NAND flash technology. We are a vertically integrated solutions provider with ownership of chip-level design and IP, front and back-end manufacturing, as well as systems engineering and design. With a differentiated innovation engine driving advancements in storage and semiconductor technologies, our broad and ever-expanding portfolio delivers powerful flash storage solutions for artificial intelligence (\"AI\") workloads in datacenters, edge devices, and consumer applications. Our technologies enable everyone from students, gamers, and home offices to the largest enterprises and public clouds to produce, analyze, and store data. Our solutions include a broad range of solid-state drives (\"SSDs\"), embedded products, removable cards, universal serial bus drives and wafers and components. Our bro","zh":"Sandisk 是全球領先的半導體記憶體公司，在 NAND 快閃記憶體技術領域擁有 30 多年的創新經驗。我們是一家垂直整合的解決方案提供商，擁有晶片級設計和IP、前端和後端製造以及系統工程和設計。憑藉推動儲存和半導體技術進步的差異化創新引擎，我們廣泛且不斷擴展的產品組合為資料中心、邊緣設備和消費應用中的人工智慧 (“AI”) 工作負載提供強大的快閃記憶體解決方案。我們的技術使從學生、遊戲玩家、家庭辦公室到最大的企業和公有雲的每個人都能夠產生、分析和儲存資料。我們的解決方案包括各種固態驅動器（“SSD”）、嵌入式產品、可移動卡、通用序列匯流排驅動器以及晶圓和組件。我們的兄弟"},{"en":"The Datacenter end market is comprised primarily of products for datacenters, cloud service providers, and private cloud customers. Through the Edge end market, we provide our original equipment manufacturer (\"OEM\") and channel customers a broad array of high-performance flash solutions across personal computer, mobile, gaming, automotive, physical AI, at-home entertainment, and industrial spaces. The Consumer end market is highlighted by our broad range of retail and other end-user products, which capitalize on the strength of our product brand recognition and vast presence around the world.","zh":"資料中心終端市場主要由資料中心、雲端服務供應商和私有雲客戶的產品組成。透過邊緣終端市場，我們為原始設備製造商（「OEM」）和通路客戶提供廣泛的高效能快閃記憶體解決方案，涵蓋個人電腦、行動、遊戲、汽車、實體人工智慧、家庭娛樂和工業空間。消費終端市場以我們廣泛的零售和其他終端用戶產品為亮點，這些產品充分利用了我們產品品牌認知度和在全球的廣泛影響力。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We and Kioxia currently operate three business ventures, Flash Partners Ltd., Flash Alliance Ltd. and Flash Forward Ltd., (collectively, \"Flash Ventures\") across eight flash-based manufacturing facilities in Japan, six of which are located in Yokkaichi, Japan and two of which are located in Kitakami, Japan. Through Flash Ventures, we and Kioxia collaborate in the development and manufacture of flash-based memory wafers using semiconductor manufacturing equipment owned or leased by each of the Flash Ventures entities. We co-develop flash technologies (including process technology and memory design) with Kioxia for Flash Ventures' use. We and Kioxia jointly own these co-developed flash technologies. We and Kioxia also contribute to the collaboration and license to each other technologies that are independently developed and owned by each of us and are reasonably necessary to our joint deve","zh":"我們和 Kioxia 目前在日本經營三家企業：Flash Partners Ltd.、Flash Alliance Ltd. 和 Flash Forward Ltd.（統稱為「Flash Ventures」），遍佈八個基於快閃記憶體的製造工廠，其中六個位於日本四日市，另外兩家位於日本北上市。透過 Flash Ventures，我們和 Kioxia 使用每個 Flash Ventures 實體擁有或租賃的半導體製造設備合作開發和製造基於快閃記憶體的記憶體晶圓。我們與 Kioxia 共同開發快閃記憶體技術（包括製程技術和記憶體設計），供 Flash Ventures 使用。我們和 Kioxia 共同擁有這些共同開發的快閃記憶體技術。我們和 Kioxia 也促進彼此獨立開發和擁有的技術的合作和許可，這些技術對於我們的共同開發來說是合理必要的。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our industry is highly competitive. We believe we are well positioned with our leading flash product portfolio, premium consumer brand, differentiated semiconductor innovation engine and leadership in driving cost efficiency. Nevertheless, we face strong competition from other manufacturers of flash in the Datacenter, Edge and Consumer end markets. We compete with vertically-integrated suppliers such as Kioxia, Micron Technology, Inc., Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd., SK Hynix, Inc., Yangtze Memory Technologies Co., Ltd. and numerous smaller companies that assemble flash into products.","zh":"我們的行業競爭非常激烈。我們相信，憑藉領先的快閃記憶體產品組合、優質消費品牌、差異化的半導體創新引擎以及在推動成本效率方面的領先地位，我們處於有利地位。儘管如此，我們在資料中心、邊緣和消費終端市場面臨其他快閃製造商的激烈競爭。我們的競爭對手包括鎧俠、美光科技公司、三星電子有限公司、SK 海力士公司、長江儲存科技有限公司以及眾多將快閃記憶體組裝到產品中的小型公司。"},{"en":"Our overall strategy is to leverage our innovation, technology and execution capabilities to be an industry-leading and broad-based global semiconductor memory company that supports the infrastructure that has enabled the unabated proliferation of data. We strive to successfully execute our strategy through the following foundational elements in order to create long-term value for our customers, partners, investors and employees:","zh":"我們的整體策略是利用我們的創新、技術和執行能力，成為業界領先、基礎廣泛的全球半導體記憶體公司，為支援資料不斷激增的基礎設施提供支援。我們努力透過以下基本要素成功執行我們的策略，為我們的客戶、合作夥伴、投資者和員工創造長期價值："}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-07-03","items":[{"name":"Edge","val":12160000000,"zh":"邊緣"},{"name":"Datacenter","val":5153000000,"zh":"資料中心"},{"name":"Consumer","val":2935000000,"zh":"消費者"}],"total":20248000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-07-03","items":[{"name":"HK","val":5126000000,"zh":"香港"},{"name":"Rest Of Asia","val":4612000000,"zh":"亞洲其他地區"},{"name":"CN","val":4503000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"US","val":3714000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1732000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Other Geographical","val":561000000,"zh":"其他地理"}],"total":20248000000}},"peers":["WDC","MU","SKHY","MRVL","NBIS"]}}